{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/touring-exhibition/82","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe in Mexico and Peru","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","id":"actor/1","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"While conducting research on O’Keeffe’s time in Peru and Mexico, we uncovered objects in both the archives and material collections that would help bring these trips to life. One case is linked to her travels in Mexico, and the other to her trip to Peru. The archival materials, on the whole, come from her travel boxes, in which she kept brochures, postcards, and other ephemera.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"Activity"}